USB ID database

This package distributes usb.ids from the USB ID Repository without changes.
Its header names Stephen J. Gowdy <linux.usb.ids@gmail.com> as maintainer.
The complete upstream header remains in the staged database.

The project site at https://usb-ids.gowdy.us/ explicitly permits distribution
of the database contents and generated files under either GPL version 2 or later
or the 3-clause BSD License. Pyxis elects the 3-clause BSD option for this data.
The grant was verified on 2026-10-03.

The Git mirror at https://github.com/usbids/usbids contains a LICENSE with the
GNU GPL version 3 text. That is not a BSD license: this package's BSD election
relies on the project site's separate grant for the database, not on the mirror
LICENSE. No other files from the mirror are distributed by this recipe.

LICENSE in this directory reproduces the standard 3-clause BSD conditions and
disclaimer. Neither the pinned database header nor the site's grant identifies
a copyright holder; this package does not invent a copyright attribution.

